PiVid is a combined hardware and software project. Most of it is licensed under
the GNU GPL v3.0-or-later, but the parts that touch the Linux kernel have no
choice of licence, and the circuit board is licensed separately. This file is
the authoritative map. Full licence texts live in LICENSES/.


