================================================================================
8. NOTE FOR DISTRIBUTORS — FFmpeg
================================================================================

apps/pivid-player links FFmpeg (libavformat, libavcodec, libavutil). Stock
Debian and Raspberry Pi OS FFmpeg builds are LGPL-2.1-or-later, or
GPL-2.0-or-later when built with --enable-gpl; both are compatible with
GPL-3.0-or-later and may be distributed with PiVid.

An FFmpeg built with --enable-nonfree is NOT GPL-compatible. Binaries of
pivid-player linked against such a build may not be distributed. If you build
your own FFmpeg, do not enable nonfree components.
